use std
into glyph.amni

This file is a module with no main (namespace glyph). It maps PostScript glyph names to Unicode (the Adobe Glyph List rules), holds the PDF StandardEncoding and the widths of the base-14 Helvetica and Times fonts for printable ASCII. Every module-level name starts with `gl_` or `GL_`.

The tables, exactly:

